From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 20:24:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: regulator: apple,pmic-touch-regulator: Add D2207

Add the touchscreen analog supply of the D2207 PMIC in the iPad Air 2.

Signed-off-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml       | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml
index ef1cc77..ad29023 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml
@@ -10,8 +10,8 @@ maintainers:
   - Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>
 
 description:
-  Fixed touchscreen supply switches provided by the D2186, Adelyn, Angel and
-  Chestnut PMICs. The compatible identifies both the PMIC and the physical supply;
+  Fixed touchscreen supply switches provided by the D2186, D2207, Adelyn,
+  Angel and Chestnut PMICs. The compatible identifies both the PMIC and the physical supply;
   register layout is an implementation detail of the regulator driver.
 
 allOf:
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@ properties:
       - apple,angel-touch-analog-regulator
       - apple,chestnut-touch-hv-regulator
       - apple,d2186-touch-core-regulator
+      - apple,d2207-touch-analog-regulator
 
 required:
   - compatible
